est, but I would like to make a repeat request.\nI would be happy to see your illustration of my own camp, as the material I was quoting from is no longer available....\n\nIf you have any problem, please feel free to cancel the request.\n\nIf there is any problem, please feel free to cancel the request.\n\n\nRequest details\nCthulhu Mythos TRPG \"What happened in Bespoke Land?\" Illustration of explorer\n\nBrief information about the explorer\nHO1 Lucian Granville\n29 years old, 180 cm, English tailor.\nHe is very flexible and joking. His motto is \"Noblesse oblige\".\n\nHO2 Ric Zelati\n26 years old, 170cm, Italian tailor\nHe is a serious man who is strict with himself and others, and is very talkative and lively.\n\nHO3 Cherish Cherry\n24 years old, 150cm, American tailor\nAn adult male who is energetic, cocky, and does the little shitty moves. He thinks he and what he produces are No. 1.\n\nHO2 and HO3 argue with each other, and HO1 tames them (but only smiles).\n\nPlease feel free to add or simplify the costumes as you like. Sorry for the succession of requests.\nThe composition and situation is up to you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TSAHWEgVTeCW_WzaTbhH_CTkOcq91Jvb?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@MaruHomare/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2536681, "client_id": 2589226, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3d6d3d60/uploads/origins/32913690-ce17-41d7-9d97-6a967a7b1406?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87a3e4b9da43089c0f4e1ae958ace20b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3d6d3d60/uploads/origins/32913690-ce17-41d7-9d97-6a967a7b1406?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87a3e4b9da43089c0f4e1ae958ace20b, https://si.imgix.net/3d6d3d60/uploads/origins/32913690-ce17-41d7-9d97-6a967a7b14